# Filippo Vicentini (MIT). NOT part of Gexis Player: fetched on the device from
# its author's GitHub release, only when the user switches Qobuz Connect on and
# has confirmed the unofficial-software notice. The checksum is the author's own
# .sha256. **2.5.1, not 2.5.0:** Finding 094 measured 2.5.0, whose asset the
# author re-published on 2026-09-27 with different bytes - the pin refused it,
# which is what it is for - before releasing 2.5.1 five minutes later.
